-- The crate's types, and its error messages word for word.
--
-- Where the crate wraps pre-release and build identifiers in types of their
-- own, this port keeps them as `String`s that `prerelease` and
-- `buildMetadata` have checked, and compares them with `comparePrerelease`
-- and `compareBuildMetadata`.
--
